      "originalSha256": "550df03997ad505c88fcfae84d9f1c098675867813bb1a15f4e3bb5b89c5672b",
      "translation": {
        "id": "32",
        "text": "辛卯年，长兴二年正月，契丹、突厥的部众归附后唐。五月，诛杀安重诲。十一月初一（甲申日），发生日食。",
        "origin": "ai",
        "version": 1,
        "language": "zh-Hans",
        "translator": "Codex（AI 初译，待人工修订）",
        "reviewNotes": [],
