    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "chunqiu-v002-p30",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "originalSha256": "c2937e046797ebd99f53c2a8fb0f5f4082a6e7cdb15bb34dd6269f3d869a119c",
      "translation": {
        "id": "67",
        "text": "甲寅年，显德元年正月初一（丙子日），皇帝在圜丘祭祀天帝，改换年号。皇帝患病。壬辰日，郭威死于滋德殿。",
        "origin": "ai",
        "version": 1,
        "language": "zh-Hans",
        "translator": "Codex（AI 初译，待人工修订）",
        "reviewNotes": [],
        "reviewStatus": "pending"
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "chunqiu-v002-p31",
